---
permalink: "/land-investment.html"
title: "Land for Lease in Nusa Penida & Bali | Bali Real Vacation"
description: "Land available for lease on Nusa Penida and Bali, listed directly by the owners we know personally. Currently: a 425 m² SHM beachfront plot in Desa Ped, 10–15 year lease."
canonical: "https://balirealvacation.com/land-investment.html"
robots: "index, follow"
ogTitle: "Land for Lease in Nusa Penida — Direct from the Owner"
ogDescription: "A 425 m² SHM plot facing Mount Agung, in front of a crystal-clear beach in Desa Ped, Nusa Penida. 10–15 year lease, no agent, no commission."
ogType: "website"
ogImage: "https://balirealvacation.com/src/assets/land/nusa-penida-land-satellite.webp"
---
{% extends "layouts/base.njk" %}

{% block jsonld %}{% include "partials/land-jsonld.njk" %}{% endblock %}

{% block headstyle %}{% raw %}<style>
        /* Page chrome. Nav, footer, floating buttons and .reveal all come from
           /css/styles.css — only what is specific to this page lives here. */
        .page-hero {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary-color, #00557f), #00365a);
            color: #fff; text-align: center; padding: 70px 20px 60px;
        }
        .page-hero h1 { font-size: 2.6rem; margin-bottom: 15px; }
        .page-hero p { font-size: 1.15rem; max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; color: #e0f0ff; }
        .page-hero .hero-tag {
            display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 18px;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,.14); color: #fff; border-radius: 20px;
            font-family: var(--font-heading, sans-serif); font-weight: 700;
            font-size: .74rem; letter-spacing: .6px; text-transform: uppercase;
            padding: 7px 14px;
        }

        .land-intro { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 55px 20px 5px; text-align: center; }
        .land-intro p { color: #555; font-size: 1.08rem; margin-bottom: 15px; }

        .land-wrapper { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 30px 20px 60px; width: 100%; }

        /* Trust strip — why deal with us / the owner */
        .land-trust {
            display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr));
            gap: 22px; margin: 0 auto 46px; max-width: 1000px;
        }
        .land-trust div {
            background: #fff; border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.05); border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 22px 20px; text-align: center; box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(4,41,62,.05);
        }
        .land-trust i { font-size: 1.5rem; color: #2f8f4e; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        .land-trust b { display: block; font-family: var(--font-heading, sans-serif); margin-bottom: 5px; }
        .land-trust span { font-size: .9rem; color: #777; line-height: 1.6; }

        /* "List your land with us" banner */
        .land-cta {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2f8f4e, #216b39);
            color: #fff; text-align: center; padding: 55px 40px; margin-top: 60px;
            border-radius: 15px; box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(47,143,78,.2);
        }
        .land-cta h2 { color: #fff; font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 15px; }
        .land-cta p { font-size: 1.08rem; margin: 0 auto 30px; max-width: 680px; color: #eafaf0; }
        .land-cta .btn-custom {
            background-color: #fff; color: #216b39; padding: 15px 35px; border-radius: 30px;
            font-family: var(--font-heading, sans-serif); font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none;
            display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; transition: all .3s ease;
        }
        .land-cta .btn-custom:hover { background-color: var(--primary-color, #00557f); color: #fff; transform: translateY(-3px); }

        .land-disclaimer {
            max-width: 900px; margin: 34px auto 0; padding: 0 20px;
            font-size: .86rem; color: #8a949a; line-height: 1.7; text-align: center;
        }

        @media(max-width: 768px) {
            .page-hero { padding: 50px 20px 45px; }
            .page-hero h1 { font-size: 2rem; }
            .land-cta { padding: 40px 22px; margin-top: 45px; }
            .land-cta h2 { font-size: 1.6rem; }
        }
    </style>{% endraw %}{% endblock %}

{% block content %}
<section class="page-hero">
    <span class="hero-tag"><i class="fa-solid fa-seedling" aria-hidden="true"></i> Investment Opportunities</span>
    <h1>Land &amp; Investment</h1>
    <p>Land available for lease on Nusa Penida and Bali — listed directly by the owners we know personally, so you deal with the person whose name is on the certificate.</p>
</section>

<div class="land-intro reveal">
    <p>We spend our days on these islands, and we are regularly asked the same question by guests who fall in love with the place: <em>is there any land available?</em> This page is our answer.</p>
    <p>Every plot here is offered by its rightful owner. We do not take a commission, we do not mark up the price, and we do not stand between you and the person you are dealing with.</p>
</div>

<main class="land-wrapper">

    <div class="land-trust reveal">
        <div>
            <i class="fa-solid fa-user-check" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            <b>Owner direct</b>
            <span>You talk to the certificate holder, not to a broker.</span>
        </div>
        <div>
            <i class="fa-solid fa-hand-holding-dollar" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            <b>No commission</b>
            <span>We list these plots as a service. The price is the owner's price.</span>
        </div>
        <div>
            <i class="fa-solid fa-file-contract" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            <b>Papers shown</b>
            <span>Certificates and plot maps are shown in full on request.</span>
        </div>
    </div>

    {% include "partials/land-listings.njk" %}

    <section class="land-cta reveal">
        <h2>Do You Have Land to Lease?</h2>
        <p>If you own land on Nusa Penida or Bali and want it seen by the travellers who already visit this site, talk to us. We list plots for owners we can verify.</p>
        <a class="btn-custom" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
           href="https://wa.me/{{ site.whatsapp }}?text={{ 'Hello Bali Real Vacation! I own land in Bali / Nusa Penida and I would like to list it on your Land & Investment page.' | urlencode | safe }}">
            <i class="fa-brands fa-whatsapp" aria-hidden="true"></i> List Your Land
        </a>
    </section>

    <p class="land-disclaimer">
        Bali Real Vacation publishes these listings as an introduction service. We are not a licensed property agent and we are not a party to any lease agreement. Always verify the certificate with a notary (PPAT) and take independent legal advice before paying any money.
    </p>

</main>
{% endblock %}
